{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">京東物流第二季多賺一成三。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">純利約24億元人民幣。經調整盈利有26.4億元人民幣，按年上升百分之2.1。 期內，收入641億元人民幣，增加兩成四。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T16:59:03.695806+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":73,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}